# Production scope. Files 0..5; 2 and 5 are not production (F file 0).
# 0 -> 1 -> 0 is a production cycle. 0 -> 2 -> 0 and 3 -> 4 -> 5 -> 3 pass through a
# non-production file, so they are no cycle. A non-production self import (2) is no edge.
pulsar-facts 0
