F 0 1
F 1 1
F 2 0
F 3 1
F 4 1
F 5 0
I 0 1 0 1 0
I 0 2 0 1 0
I 1 0 0 1 0
I 2 0 0 1 0
I 2 2 0 1 0
I 3 4 0 1 0
I 4 5 0 1 0
I 5 3 0 1 0
